      "totalDuration": "1 yr 6 mos",
      "description": "- Helped design and build a serverless EHR message routing system on AWS using API Gateway, Lambda, and SQS that identifies, decrypts, processes, and routes eight message types. It is now in production handling several hundred messages a day.\n \n- Wrote TypeScript Lambda functions for EHR ingestion and outbound integrations.\n \n- Set up initial deployment infrastructure using Terraform, CloudFormation, and AWS CDK.\n \n- Proposed replacing Django with FastAPI after finding the existing application was working against its own data models and schemas, then built a working prototype. The approach was adopted and is still in use.\n \n- Built data-processing services with Python, FastAPI, Pydantic, and PostgreSQL.",
